.TH WM-MEDIA 1
.SH NAME
avi, qt, wmplay \- media player windows
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wm/avi
.br
.B wm/qt
.br
.B wm/wmplay
.RI [ file ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A collection of media-playback windows under the Wm window manager.
.PP
.TP
.B wm/avi
Plays Microsoft AVI movie files. Started with no arguments; use its
.B Open
menu to locate an
.B .avi
file.
.TP
.B wm/qt
Plays Apple QuickTime
.B .mov
files. Started with no arguments; use its
.B Open
menu to locate a file.
.TP
.B wm/wmplay
A simple media player.
.I File
may be given directly on the command line, or chosen afterward from
the player's own controls.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/wm/avi.b
.br
.B /appl/wm/qt.b
.br
.B /appl/wm/wmplay.b
